      "repo": "alpha-studios-demo/harbor",
      "featured": true,
      "story": "Freelancers told us the hardest part of money was not earning it but knowing what was theirs to spend. Harbor sets tax aside the moment an invoice is paid, shows a single safe-to-spend number, and syncs quietly between iPhone and Mac with no accounts to create. We built it native in SwiftUI so it opens instantly and feels at home on both devices. Kenji led the app, Aarav built the sync and receipts service, Zara shaped the interface and Mateo kept it honest in testing.",
