      "repo": "alpha-studios-demo/lumen",
      "featured": true,
      "story": "Lumen began as a late-night fix for a friend with four deadlines and no plan. You add what is due, and it breaks the work into short evening sessions you can actually finish, then celebrates each one with a small burst of light. The web app runs on React and Postgres, with an Android companion in Kotlin for reminders. It is in open beta while we listen to students about what to add next. Zara led the web interface, Priya built the Android app, Aarav the backend and Mateo the research.",
